END

Name:SovietDemolitionTruck
"Demolition Truck"
END

Type:SovietDemolitionTruck
"Suicide Vehicle"
END

Desc:SovietDemolitionTruck
"Suicide truck built on an Ore Collector chassis (cannot harvest ore). Drives into its target and detonates on contact, and also explodes when destroyed, with the force of a medium time bomb, leaving a radioactive fallout zone (Desolator Airstrike level 1). Same speed as the Ore Collector. Ability: 1.5x speed boost for 5s (10s cooldown). Requires a Super Reactor."
END

Name:SpySatellite
"Spy Satellite"
END

Type:SpySatellite
"Intelligence Structure"
END

Desc:SpySatellite
"Satellite uplink that reveals the entire battlefield while it stands. Requires a tech lab (Defense Bureau, Battle Lab or Nanotech Mainframe). Uses 75 power."
END

Name:AlliedBattleFortress
"Battle Fortress"
END

Type:AlliedBattleFortress
"Armored Transport"
END

Desc:AlliedBattleFortress
"Heavily armored amphibious assault transport built on the Riptide ACV hull. Keeps the Riptide machine gun and torpedoes. Carries up to 5 infantry; like the Multigunner IFV, passengers add their own weapons to the fortress. Twice the armor of a Riptide ACV. Built at the War Factory."
END

Desc:AlliedMarine1_Buildable
"Presidential transport helicopter armed with prism weaponry. Can attack both air and ground targets. Carries up to 5 passengers."
END

